      "html": "<div class=\"\"><div class=\"row  hasChildData \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div  class=\"row table-row first-row js-collapse-trigger collapse-trigger \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\"><span class=\"toggle-arrow\"><svg width=\"6\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 6 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4.7294 4.45711L0.733399 7.82311L1.1294 8.29111L5.6654 4.45711L1.1294 0.641113L0.751398 1.12711L4.7294 4.45711Z\" fill=\"black\"/></svg></span> data&nbsp;[<em>required</em>]</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">[object]</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">A batch of daily AI tool activity entries. A batch must contain between 1 and 1000 entries.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row isNested d-none hasChildData \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"data\" class=\"row table-row first-row js-collapse-trigger collapse-trigger \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\"><span class=\"toggle-arrow\"><svg width=\"6\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 6 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4.7294 4.45711L0.733399 7.82311L1.1294 8.29111L5.6654 4.45711L1.1294 0.641113L0.751398 1.12711L4.7294 4.45711Z\" fill=\"black\"/></svg></span> attributes&nbsp;[<em>required</em>]</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">object</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Daily AI coding tool activity for a single user. Each entry reports whether the user was\nactive on a given day and which AI tools and models they used.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">day&nbsp;[<em>required</em>]</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">date</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">The day the activity refers to, in <code>YYYY-MM-DD</code> format.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">is_active&nbsp;[<em>required</em>]</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">boolean</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Whether the user actively used the listed AI tools on that day.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">models</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">[string]</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">The AI models the user used on that day, for example <code>claude-sonnet-4.5</code> or <code>gpt-5</code>.\nValues are lowercased and duplicates are removed.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">tools&nbsp;[<em>required</em>]</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">[string]</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">The AI coding tools the user used on that day, for example <code>Claude Code</code>, <code>Cursor</code>, or\n<code>GitHub Copilot</code>. Known tools are normalized to a canonical name (<code>claude_code</code>, <code>cursor</code>,\n<code>copilot</code>), and other values are converted to snake case. Entries must not be empty.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">user_email&nbsp;[<em>required</em>]</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">string</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">The email address of the user. It is case-insensitive and is matched against the\nemail addresses of commit authors.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"data\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">type&nbsp;[<em>required</em>]</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">enum</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">JSON:API type for AI Impact user activity entries. \nAllowed enum values: <code>ai_impact_user_activity</code></p><p>default: <code>ai_impact_user_activity</code></p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n          </div>\n        </div></div>"
    }
